            <note corresp="#d609-f2" n="64" xml:id="d609-f2-content">
                <p>Telegram 3905, August 20, 1945, 3 p.m., to Paris, stated: “We would have no
                    objection to solution set forth in Embtel 4986, Aug 17, 9 p.m.”
                    (881.00/8–1745)</p>
            </note>
